  <DocumentLink id="27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" target-id="SD:f9131c26-c3b5-5ece-aa82-344f8adcbb92" type="Default" />
  <Item id="5074f465-3829-58a0-8a13-98e1aa439cb0" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSC-000</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+40%">Functional Safety Concept — Rear PTO</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Safety goals and functional safety requirements per ISO 25119-2:2018, Clause 7. Every hazardous situation with AgPLr &gt; QM maps to a safety goal; FSRs inherit the AgPLr of their goal. The selected combination of category, MTTFd, DC and SRL that achieves each AgPL is recorded in §3.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="ed772fbd-1031-581c-9c76-178aa1295c21" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">1. Safety goals</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="f65bc9ab-a045-5e1b-8f0f-b723b73e840c" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SG-01</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The PTO shall not engage unless a deliberate, valid operator engage command is present.</Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Safe state: clutch valve de-energised → clutch open, spring brake applied.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-HZ-01, -02</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="9bfc303c-784f-5160-8d6c-c3cf58e55a26" target-id="SDI:f22cd714-04df-5d73-97c0-ffd54c3254ee" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="db48719c-d077-5999-8952-b2e08cd4e25d" target-id="SDI:0b29ff6f-dd16-5e6a-b101-98a5d55a96ea" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="e43b4f9f-61dc-5951-8f02-b0f63a20da66" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SG-02</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>On a stop command or a stop condition the PTO shall be disengaged within 400 ms; the stop function has priority over any engage request (Annex F.3).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-HZ-03</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="45117323-90d1-5ff6-97b9-e3de7dfb971d" target-id="SDI:12ec2703-da97-570f-b2f6-20ad114c8a9f" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="a9487822-4f58-59c4-8e0c-d15406b49149" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SG-03</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The PTO shall not re-engage automatically: after power-up, after engine stall/restart, and after operator-presence loss, re-engagement requires a new deliberate command from the OFF position (manual reset, Annex F.4/F.5).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-HZ-04, -05</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="cca228e9-e83b-593f-9113-36d448e4eaab" target-id="SDI:28c09e1f-e36f-58b5-a30b-35ba7cb36e2e" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="f5821dc4-7507-5448-b067-25209c54d602" target-id="SDI:27283342-1009-5922-ba08-bb3f0bfe5ffc" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="b3b6fb41-f007-589a-8b98-497992d01217" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SG-04</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>External (fender) engagement shall act only while the button is actively held, shall limit the shaft to creep speed (≤ 20 rpm), and shall never latch.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-HZ-06</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="06ecee52-1892-538e-a592-6267b10f2201" target-id="SDI:ca294265-87e4-5a2f-939c-faadf79de97e" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="8b78d0ec-43fe-592b-bf68-5d1541c8545d" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-SG-05</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The PTO shall keep the shaft inside the selected mode's speed envelope (≤ +10 %) and shall transfer torque through a controlled engagement ramp.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-HZ-07, -08</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="e14232e3-0d85-5d14-ac53-790d2cdb9afe" target-id="SDI:fca994ab-2006-5aab-b190-6fdec3def2e1" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="1fdd5be2-0293-5c9e-adef-c844fa013b34" target-id="SDI:80e676f8-62da-5190-acb3-bc93ef93394b" doc-link-id="CDL:27d17c02-5cae-5ae6-a021-4499d9bdd490" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="ca8803a6-2e6d-519b-8932-c0932d10d37e" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">2. Functional safety requirements</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="20bbce62-d02a-5120-be38-011adaeea9b8" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-001</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>An engage command shall be accepted only as the valid two-step cab sequence (collar lifted, then switch pressed) with both switch contacts agreeing within 50 ms.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-01</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="bae9acc9-c473-515a-8a83-a3ea36d620b0" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-002</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Engagement shall require independent agreement of two processing channels; no single E/E/PES fault shall energise the clutch valve.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-01</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="84c6b327-c219-50b2-b9f7-73fd77db05e8" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-003</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>At power-up the PTO output shall stay disabled until the start interlock passes: self-test complete, engage command absent, presence state valid (Annex F.2).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-01, -03</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="f79ddebf-183c-59e9-9e4a-0dbb554cf975" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>A detected dangerous fault in the engage path shall force and latch the safe state; recovery only via manual reset with the fault cleared.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-01</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="cc0eadcb-6e74-5e63-af70-82e30a4df870" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-005</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>A stop demand (switch OFF, either contact opening, presence loss &gt; 1 s in mobile mode, monitor request) shall always be executable independently by each channel.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-02</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="8d659430-6f5e-535c-b03d-3f4933f6439b" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-006</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The reaction chain stop-demand → valve de-energised → clutch open → brake applied shall complete within 400 ms (response time per 25119-1, 3.38).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-02</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="95ea2f41-daea-5622-82c4-0396c29a90c6" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-007</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The engaged state shall not be restored from memory: no engage state may survive a power cycle, brown-out or ECU reset.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-03</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="51b027c1-fd32-5146-b3ec-52f18affd6af" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-008</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Operator presence shall be monitored with plausibility (two contacts); in mobile operation, presence loss &gt; 1 s shall trigger the stop chain. Stationary work mode requires a deliberate enable and engine-speed limit.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-03</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="ff80e3ee-c51c-50d4-9a41-1c390c914d57" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-009</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Fender engagement shall be accepted only with the cab switch OFF, shall run the shaft at creep (≤ 20 rpm, jog pulses), and shall stop within 200 ms of button release.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-04</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="169d4fd3-ae08-5d30-9c87-5c54b2df9e2e" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-010</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Fender-button stuck-at conditions shall be detected (release supervision) and shall inhibit external engagement.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-04</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="a05a9889-02c9-52bf-950b-59af5c27ffa8" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-011</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Shaft speed shall be supervised against the selected mode; a sustained excursion beyond +10 % shall raise a warning and trigger a controlled disengage (degraded stop).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-05</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="e5b04a24-3d18-5c50-8411-90e2799936d8" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-012</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The selected speed mode shall be read redundantly (coded lever + measured engine/shaft ratio) and mismatches shall inhibit engagement.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-05</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="0a20f3af-a3d3-5c0b-a99f-f70701b2dacd" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-013</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Engagement shall modulate clutch pressure along a ramp (≤ 2.0 s, slip supervised); step engagement shall be prevented.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-05</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="42d777de-7d7b-57e8-a04c-0a85249a23af" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-014</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Detected faults and degraded modes shall be indicated to the operator (lamp + buzzer via cluster); indication is QM and shall not be relied on for any safety function.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Derived from">
      <Value>PTO-SG-02</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
</StructuredDocument>
